# MTT Unified Source Theorem

This repository has one mandate:

> Construct or exclude one selected upper MTT source whose certified readouts
> reproduce the retained q79, quantum, field-theoretic, Standard-Model and
> gravitational structures.

The project begins at **hypothesis tier**. It does not claim a theory of
everything, a selected physical Hull-Strominger background, no-knob Standard
Model values, or UV-complete quantum gravity.

## Favored Candidate

The strongest current candidate is not another finite matrix. It is an
augmented derived germ of one selected q79 Hull-Strominger solution. Two
presentations remain live: an ordinary bundle germ and a physical
derived-cohesive germ plus transform. They are nested rather than disjoint:
every ordinary bundle germ has a canonical cohesive presentation, while the
reverse physical representability test remains open.

```text
selected q79 differential/Picard source
  + physical visible V3 and hidden twisted W9
  + one common positive Hermitian/Gauduchon chamber
  + tangent connection and metric
  -> one point s_* in a q79 Hull-Strominger moduli stack
  -> its augmented elliptic L-infinity deformation algebra
  -> a conjectural cyclic/action enhancement
  -> one gauge-fixed nonlinear closure-defect map Phi_Y
```

This is "one source" in the mathematical sense: one gauge-equivalence class
with one formal neighborhood and one source hash. It is not one scalar, and it
does not pretend that a structured physical background has no components.

