0 -> R(-18)^18+R(-19)+R(-22)
  -> R(-12)+R(-13)+R(-16)^40+R(-17)^7
  -> R(-11)^4+R(-14)^15+R(-15)^11
  -> R -> A -> 0,
```

with `length(A)=656` and socle type 20. Equivalently, its degree-15 dual is
generated by a mixed-degree inverse system with 18 primitives in degree 15
and one each in degrees 16 and 19. Its derivative closure is

```text
