also remain open before global H02 rank equality. No continuum/HYM or physical
endpoint follows from the finite complex alone.

The intrinsic conic fourth-Laplacian and one-scalar catalecticant shortcuts
were tested and fail; the mixed-degree type-20 source is the surviving apolar
